ler-submersible-pump42582349930.jpg\" onmousemove=\"preview(this);\" src=\"/uploads/201816806/small/multistage-impeller-submersible-pump42582349930.jpg\"/></span></li></ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"fr\">\n<h1 class=\"title-h1\">Multistage Impeller Submersible Pump</h1>\n<p>We supply multistage impeller submersible pump. Submersible pumps for domestic use, multistage type with floating radial impeller. Suitable for 4’’ wells. We are expecting become your long-term partner. 1. Product Parameter (specification) Materials Outer...</p>\n<a class=\"special_read\" href=\"#p1\" rel=\"nofollow\">Send Inquiry</a>\n<div class=\"share-btn-list\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"watch_botton\">\n<div class=\"button_box\">\n<button class=\"the_first\">Product Details</button>\n<p><input id=\"productID\" name=\"productID\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"52044696\"/></p><p><strong>multistage impeller submersible pump</strong><br/></p><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808231535553757008.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image007(001).jpg\"/></p><p>We supply multistage impeller submersible pump. Submersible pumps for domestic use, multistage type with floating radial impeller. Suitable for 4’’ wells.  We are expecting become your long-term partner.</p><p><strong>1. Product Parameter (specification)</strong></p><p>Materials</p><p>Outer case, discharge body, suction strainer, pump support and pump shaft in stainless steel.</p><p>Diffusers in technopolymer. Floating impellers in Noryl(glass loaded polymer).</p><p>Motor</p><p>oil cooled</p><p>Class F insulation.</p><p>Protection IP 68.</p><p>Continuous operation.</p><p>Built-out thermal protection.</p><p>Limitations</p><p>Maximum liquid temperature: 35 °C.</p><p>Maximum quantity of sand in suspension: 150 g/m3.</p><p>Equipment</p><p>Complete with pre-fitted cable tail.</p><p>Integral non return valve.</p><p><strong>2. Performance Curve</strong></p><p><strong><img alt=\"image009(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808231537087182427.jpg\"/></strong></p><p><strong><img alt=\"image005(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808231535505553460.jpg\" style=\"white-space: normal;\"/></strong></p><p><strong>3. Spare Parts</strong></p><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"table\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr class=\"firstRow\"><td style=\"\" valign=\"top\" width=\"383\"><p>Plastic Impeller</p><p><img alt=\"image011(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808231537439994838.jpg\"/></p><p>·High durable PPO impeller and diffuser (high flow model with S/S diffuser), sand resistant</p><p>·Floating impeller design, avoid stuck</p><p><br/></p></td><td style=\"\" valign=\"top\" width=\"383\"><p>Mechanical Seal</p><p><img alt=\"image013(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808231537521229057.jpg\"/></p><p>·No oil-leakage keep the well safe</p><p>·Water and sand proof keep the motor safe</p><p><br/></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"\" valign=\"top\" width=\"383\"><p>Stator</p><p><img alt=\"image015(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808231538027636982.jpg\"/></p><p>·Keep power durable and more efficiency</p><p>·Continuous operating guaranteed</p><p><br/></p></td><td style=\"\" valign=\"top\" width=\"383\"><p>Pump Shaft</p><p><img alt=\"image017(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808231538124073091.jpg\"/></p><p>·Dia. 12mm</p><p>·Much stronger, no distortion(especially for the longer pumps)</p><p><br/></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><strong>4. Features</strong></p><p>•Corrosion and wear resistant</p><p>•Environment-friendly </p><p>•Approved for drinking water</p><p>•Trouble-free long-term operation </p><p>•Long motor lives </p><p>•High operating reliability and long service life </p><p>•Extra-slim design, ideal for pumping water from deep wells </p><p>•Ideal for private use and professional operators</p><p><strong>5. Application Limit</strong></p><p>• Temperature of the liquid to +35 °C</p><p>• Maximum sand content 150 g/m³</p><p>• Installation:</p><p>– vertical</p><p>– horizontal, keep minimum 30 cm space to the water bottom to avoid sand</p><p>• Starts/hour: 24 hours at regular intervals</p><p>• Minimum flow rate for motor cooling 8 cm/s</p><p><img alt=\"image019(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808231541483819443.jpg\"/></p><p><strong>6. Our Services</strong></p><p>1. All products will be well packed before shipping.</p><p>2. Reply your inquiry in 24 working hours.</p><p>3. As an honest seller, we always use high quality material, advanced machines, skilled technicians to ensure quality</p><p><br/></p>\n</div>\n<p class=\"productsTags\"> Hot Tags: multistage impeller submersible pump, China, suppliers, manufacturers, buy</p>\n<div class=\"ptit\">Related Products</div>\n<ul class=\"rollPro1\">\n<li>\n<div class=\"pbox\"><a href=\"/4-submersible-pump/100qjd-4-submersible-water-pump/submersible-pump\"><img alt=\"Submersible Pump\" border=\"0\" src=\"/uploads/201816806/small/submersible-pump13476137041a77d.jpg?size=263x0\"/></a></div>\n<p><a href=\"/4-submersible-pump/100qjd-4-submersible-water-pump/submersible-pump\">Submersible Pump</a></p>\n</li><li>\n<div class=\"pbox\"><a href=\"/4-submersible-pump/4-ss-submersible-pump/submersible-bore-pump\"><img alt=\"Submersible Bore Pump\" border=\"0\" src=\"/uploads/201816806/small/submersible-bore-pump39394512947a77d.jpg?size=263x0\"/></a></div>\n<p><a href=\"/4-submersible-pump/4-ss-submersible-pump/submersible-bore-pump\">Submersible Bore Pump</a></p>\n</li><li>\n<div class=\"pbox\"><a href=\"/4-submersible-pump/4-ss-submersible-pump/deep-well-pump\"><img alt=\"Deep Well Pump\" border=\"0\" src=\"/uploads/201816806/small/deep-well-pump14147696483a77d.jpg?size=263x0\"/></a></div>\n<p><a href=\"/4-submersible-pump/4-ss-submersible-pump/deep-well-pump\">Deep Well Pump</a></p>\n</li><li>\n<div class=\"pbox\"><a href=\"/5-submersible-pump/5-submersible-impeller-pump/water-pump-impeller\"><img alt=\"Water Pump Impeller\" border